msgstr ""
"Project-Id-Version: inzone-buds-mixer\n"
"Report-Msgid-Bugs-To: \n"
"POT-Creation-Date: 2026-10-15 19:41-0300\n"
"PO-Revision-Date: 2026-10-15 00:00+0000\n"
"Last-Translator: Claude (draft, needs native review)\n"
"Language-Team: Hindi\n"
